      "content": "I understand your concerns about financial limitations, but I strongly advise against using ibuprofen as a solution as it may exacerbate the issue, especially if there's a potential inner ear problem. The dizzy and numbing sensation in your arm could be related to the visual disturbance, as they often accompany conditions like BPPV or inner ear issues. Ibuprofen can mask symptoms temporarily but may not address the underlying cause. Visiting an urgent care or a local clinic that offers financial assistance might be a better option to address your concerns.",
